      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.historictexas.net/city/putnam-texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1966, Putnam earned recognition as a Recorded Texas Historic Landmark, preserving its early heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
