      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.historictexas.net/city/putnam-texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Author King, famed for \"The Best Little Whorehouse in Texas,\" was born in Putnam in 1929.",
