      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Putnam%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Callahan County’s historic marker notes Putnam’s coordinates at 32°22′15.4668″N 99°11′33.2556″W, guiding visitors to its center.",
